# Seven WIDENED rows in `compat/BREAKING`, not CHANGED: `sysResult`
# builds an `Error`, so each row gains `Alloc`. That is the same tax
# 0.6.1 declared for every `Err.ax` export and it is the whole of the
# cost - measured, `sysResult`'s message is a LITERAL op name, so
# nothing here concatenates on the success path.

